  "releaseNotes": "1.2.0: Added SKIP to WITH and RETURN, including EXISTS subqueries and UNION branches. Integer literals and parameters are validated; execution preserves host rows, cancellation, and resource disposal without database pushdown.\nAdded searched and simple CASE expressions with lazy branch evaluation, null fallback, parameter binding, and asynchronous EXISTS support. CASE arguments enable conditional count/sum aggregation.\nFull changelog: https://github.com/JornWildt/Cyphoid/blob/master/CHANGES.md",
